由
$$
\begin{cases}
u=u(x,y)\\
v=v(x,y)
\end{cases}
$$
在题设方程组两边对 $x$ 求偏导，得
$$
\begin{cases}
1=-2u\cdot\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}+\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}\\
0=\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}+2v\cdot\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}
\end{cases}
$$
$$
\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}=\frac{-2v}{4uv+1},\quad
\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}=\frac{1}{4uv+1}
$$
同理，在题设方程组两边对 $y$ 求偏导，可得
$$
\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}=\frac{1}{4uv+1},\quad
\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}=\frac{2u}{4uv+1}
$$

